{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛。現時港島綫列車服務受阻，由總站至總站的整體行車時間預計需要額外 5至 8分鐘。<br/>\n<br/>\n港鐵呼籲乘客為行程預留充裕時間。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T01:23:20.081268+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T00:54:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T04:59:24.200784+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T01:16:49.203421+00:00","content_hash":"d6fd5d227363666c42325159a7e83ba49fdc2ba22668b47eceb7a9ab3c4719b5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}